&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Init&lt;/b&gt; +0 ; &lt;b&gt;Sens&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Perception.html&quot; title=&quot;Perception&quot;&gt;Perception&lt;/a&gt; +10
&lt;/div&gt;
