&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;VD&lt;/b&gt; 9 m (6 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; b&#226;ton, +4 (1d6–1)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Attaque sp&#233;ciale&lt;/b&gt; forme animale 2/jour
